              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza ekibi, esagama yakyo enyakwihirweho ekicweka yaleetwa Omukiikaro Ekirukwera, kuganyiza ekibi, ekihongwa eki tikiri ky'okuliibwa; ky'okwokya n'omurro.",
